		</div>
		<div class="col-lg-6">
			<h3 class="h4">Prescott</h3>
			<p>1652 Cty Rd 2, Prescott, Ontario K0E 1T0<br><a href="tel:6139252777">613-925-2777</a></p>
			<iframe title="Map showing the Artisan Kitchen and Bath Prescott showroom" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=1652+Cty+Rd+2+Prescott+Ontario&output=embed" width="100%" height="300" style="border:0" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen></iframe>
		</div>
